  "translation": "My friend and I went to the bookstore. We wanted to buy several books. Walking into the bookstore, there were many people inside. I first looked at a history book. That book was very thick. My friend asked me: 'What book will you buy?' I said: 'Haven't decided yet.' Then we together walked to the right bookshelf. I saw this book. I liked it very much and decided to buy a history book. I was really happy. Coming out of the bookstore, we went home."
